{"id":"c4f0c170aff0bb4a","group":"92","path":"92/92-ex-hierarchy-examples.md","title":"Arithmetic Hierarchy Examples","display":"ex-hierarchy-examples — Arithmetic Hierarchy Examples","type":"example","metadata":{"type":"example","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-ex-hierarchy-examples","aliases":["92-ex-hierarchy-examples"],"display":"ex-hierarchy-examples — Arithmetic Hierarchy Examples","depends_on":["[[92-df-delta0-formula]]","[[92-df-sigma1-formula]]","[[92-df-pi1-formula]]","[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","[[92-fact-provability-sigma1]]","[[92-df-consistency-statement]]","[[92-df-contradiction]]","[[92-df-godel-numbering]]","[[92-df-numeral]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"example"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-ex-hierarchy-examples"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-ex-hierarchy-examples</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"ex-hierarchy-examples — Arithmetic Hierarchy Examples"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d754a154b50a9533\" href=\"?note=d754a154b50a9533\" title=\"92-df-delta0-formula\">92-df-delta0-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"8fd1dce21b2c65db\" href=\"?note=8fd1dce21b2c65db\" title=\"92-df-sigma1-formula\">92-df-sigma1-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"140342deea557884\" href=\"?note=140342deea557884\" title=\"92-df-pi1-formula\">92-df-pi1-formula</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"e9cc91aaee998c7b\" href=\"?note=e9cc91aaee998c7b\" title=\"92-df-provability-predicate\">92-df-provability-predicate</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"076e69cbf2d46206\" href=\"?note=076e69cbf2d46206\" title=\"92-fact-provability-sigma1\">92-fact-provability-sigma1</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"68f172d58c15e75d\" href=\"?note=68f172d58c15e75d\" title=\"92-df-consistency-statement\">92-df-consistency-statement</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0dd7c9b3e61cc21b\" href=\"?note=0dd7c9b3e61cc21b\" title=\"92-df-contradiction\">92-df-contradiction</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0^G,\\Sigma_1^G,\\Pi_1^G\">\\(\\Delta_0^G,\\Sigma_1^G,\\Pi_1^G\\)</span> (arithmetic-hierarchy classes, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"d754a154b50a9533\" href=\"?note=d754a154b50a9533\" title=\"92-df-delta0-formula\">92-df-delta0-formula</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"8fd1dce21b2c65db\" href=\"?note=8fd1dce21b2c65db\" title=\"92-df-sigma1-formula\">92-df-sigma1-formula</a>, <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"140342deea557884\" href=\"?note=140342deea557884\" title=\"92-df-pi1-formula\">92-df-pi1-formula</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\Delta_0^G\">\\(\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\Delta_0^G\\)</span> (a bounded internal formula representing the external proof relation)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_G:\\mathrm{Term}_G\\to\\mathrm{Fml}_G\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_G\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_G\\)</span> (internal provability constructor and consistency sentence)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bot_G\">\\(\\bot_G\\)</span> (fixed contradiction, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"0dd7c9b3e61cc21b\" href=\"?note=0dd7c9b3e61cc21b\" title=\"92-df-contradiction\">92-df-contradiction</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\">\\(\\ulcorner\\cdot\\urcorner\\)</span> (Gödel numbering, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" href=\"?note=2413c1d0ca8a0ce6\" title=\"92-df-godel-numbering\">92-df-godel-numbering</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bar n\">\\(\\bar n\\)</span> (numeral for <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span>, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-15\" data-note=\"b78092e29a02d697\" href=\"?note=b78092e29a02d697\" title=\"92-df-numeral\">92-df-numeral</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}examples}\\vdash\n\\Bigl(\\forall v_0&lt;S(\\bar n)\\;\\neg(S(v_0)=0)\\Bigr)\\in\\Delta_0^G,\n\\qquad\n\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\Delta_0^G\\Longrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\in\\Sigma_1^G\n\\land\\mathrm{Con}_G\\in\\Pi_1^G\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ex\\text{-}hierarchy\\text{-}examples}\\vdash\n\\Bigl(\\forall v_0&lt;S(\\bar n)\\;\\neg(S(v_0)=0)\\Bigr)\\in\\Delta_0^G,\n\\qquad\n\\dot{\\mathrm{Prf}}_G\\in\\Delta_0^G\\Longrightarrow\n\\left[\n\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner})\\in\\Sigma_1^G\n\\land\\mathrm{Con}_G\\in\\Pi_1^G\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0\">\\(\\Delta_0\\)</span>：只有有界量词，可判定</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>例子是把句子码numeral代入内部可证性公式；外部<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_G\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_G\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\)</span>不能出现在对象语言层级中</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span>例子是<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_G=\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot_G\\urcorner})\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_G=\\neg\\mathrm{Prov}_G(\\overline{\\ulcorner\\bot_G\\urcorner})\\)</span>；其层级上界依赖内部证明公式确为<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Delta_0^G\">\\(\\Delta_0^G\\)</span></li>\n<li>在标准模型的集合定义意义下，一元<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span>公式给出c.e.集合，一元<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span>公式给出co-c.e.集合；不能把公式类本身与集合直接等同</li>\n<li>层级越高，复杂度越高</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-delta0-formula","status":"resolved","id":"d754a154b50a9533","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-delta0-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-sigma1-formula","status":"resolved","id":"8fd1dce21b2c65db","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-sigma1-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-pi1-formula","status":"resolved","id":"140342deea557884","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-pi1-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"e9cc91aaee998c7b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-provability-predicate]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-fact-provability-sigma1","status":"resolved","id":"076e69cbf2d46206","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-fact-provability-sigma1]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistency-statement","status":"resolve